{"id":"vol8-03","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol8-03/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":351.27,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.12,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.24],["turn",0.24,0.56],["to",0.56,0.74],["section",0.74,1.02],["2",1.02,1.62],["on",1.62,2.18],["page",2.18,2.5],["3.",2.5,3.12]]},{"start":8.56,"end":9.44,"text":"Section 2.","words":[["Section",8.56,8.86],["2.",8.86,9.44]]},{"start":10.44,"end":17.78,"text":"You will hear a talk about two new initiatives to encourage bicycle use in a city in Australia.","words":[["You",10.44,10.64],["will",10.64,10.8],["hear",10.8,11.02],["a",11.02,11.28],["talk",11.28,11.62],["about",11.62,12.26],["two",12.26,12.84],["new",12.84,13.22],["initiatives",13.22,13.8],["to",13.8,14.4],["encourage",14.4,14.86],["bicycle",14.86,15.52],["use",15.52,16.0],["in",16.0,16.58],["a",16.58,16.74],["city",16.74,16.98],["in",16.98,17.24],["Australia.",17.24,17.78]]},{"start":18.84,"end":24.98,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15 on page 3.","words":[["First,",18.84,19.5],["you",20.0,20.18],["have",20.18,20.36],["some",20.36,20.54],["time",20.54,21.0],["to",21.0,21.5],["look",21.5,21.66],["at",21.66,21.78],["questions",21.78,22.1],["11",22.1,22.74],["to",22.74,23.04],["15",23.04,23.56],["on",23.56,24.08],["page",24.08,24.38],["3.",24.38,24.98]]},{"start":50.26,"end":54.66,"text":"Now, listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.","words":[["Now,",50.26,50.62],["listen",50.88,51.22],["carefully",51.22,51.74],["and",51.74,52.56],["answer",52.56,52.88],["questions",52.88,53.26],["11",53.26,53.94],["to",53.94,54.22],["15.",54.22,54.66]]},{"start":54.66,"end":63.56,"text":"Thank you for all coming to today's information session on bicycle use in the inner city.","words":[["Thank",54.66,55.24],["you",57.92,58.82],["for",58.82,59.14],["all",59.14,59.36],["coming",59.36,59.72],["to",59.72,60.08],["today's",60.08,60.54],["information",60.54,60.76],["session",60.76,61.36],["on",61.36,61.78],["bicycle",61.78,62.22],["use",62.22,62.56],["in",62.56,62.96],["the",62.96,63.12],["inner",63.12,63.34],["city.",63.34,63.56]]},{"start":64.1,"end":69.26,"text":"I'll start by telling you about the city council's new bicycle hire scheme, which is","words":[["I'll",64.1,64.58],["start",64.58,64.82],["by",64.82,65.06],["telling",65.06,65.3],["you",65.3,65.5],["about",65.5,65.7],["the",65.7,65.94],["city",65.94,66.18],["council's",66.18,66.82],["new",66.82,67.24],["bicycle",67.24,67.68],["hire",67.68,68.1],["scheme,",68.1,68.54],["which",68.82,69.02],["is",69.02,69.26]]},{"start":69.26,"end":70.38,"text":"called CityCycle.","words":[["called",69.26,69.56],["CityCycle.",69.56,70.38]]},{"start":71.32,"end":77.2,"text":"We want to provide people who don't own a bike a convenient way to get around the inner","words":[["We",71.32,71.66],["want",71.66,71.9],["to",71.9,72.06],["provide",72.06,72.34],["people",72.34,72.88],["who",72.88,73.18],["don't",73.18,73.56],["own",73.56,73.98],["a",73.98,74.1],["bike",74.1,74.4],["a",74.4,74.96],["convenient",74.96,75.44],["way",75.44,75.84],["to",75.84,76.08],["get",76.08,76.2],["around",76.2,76.54],["the",76.54,76.88],["inner",76.88,77.2]]},{"start":77.2,"end":77.44,"text":"city.","words":[["city.",77.2,77.44]]},{"start":78.32,"end":83.84,"text":"Now, to use CityCycle, first you need to subscribe to the service and you can do","words":[["Now,",78.32,78.66],["to",78.84,79.04],["use",79.04,79.4],["CityCycle,",79.4,80.28],["first",80.52,80.94],["you",80.94,81.22],["need",81.22,81.34],["to",81.34,81.5],["subscribe",81.5,81.92],["to",81.92,82.28],["the",82.28,82.38],["service",82.38,82.72],["and",82.72,83.36],["you",83.36,83.56],["can",83.56,83.66],["do",83.66,83.84]]},{"start":83.84,"end":84.46,"text":"that online.","words":[["that",83.84,84.0],["online.",84.0,84.46]]},{"start":85.0,"end":90.24,"text":"Just go to the city council website and follow the prompts and you'll be sent a","words":[["Just",85.0,85.52],["go",85.52,85.84],["to",85.84,86.14],["the",86.14,86.36],["city",86.36,86.62],["council",86.62,87.0],["website",87.0,87.46],["and",87.46,88.16],["follow",88.16,88.48],["the",88.48,88.66],["prompts",88.66,88.94],["and",88.94,89.56],["you'll",89.56,89.76],["be",89.76,90.0],["sent",90.0,90.14],["a",90.14,90.24]]},{"start":90.24,"end":95.18,"text":"card. Once you've done that you can unlock one of our bikes from any station","words":[["card.",90.24,90.48],["Once",91.12,91.64],["you've",91.64,91.84],["done",91.84,91.96],["that",91.96,92.26],["you",92.26,92.66],["can",92.66,92.82],["unlock",92.82,93.28],["one",93.28,93.54],["of",93.54,93.66],["our",93.66,93.76],["bikes",93.76,94.1],["from",94.1,94.38],["any",94.38,94.8],["station",94.8,95.18]]},{"start":95.18,"end":100.24,"text":"in the inner city area. Just go to the station and log on at the computer","words":[["in",95.18,95.58],["the",95.58,95.78],["inner",95.78,95.98],["city",95.98,96.3],["area.",96.3,96.74],["Just",97.48,97.8],["go",97.8,98.04],["to",98.04,98.26],["the",98.26,98.36],["station",98.36,98.72],["and",98.72,99.36],["log",99.36,99.58],["on",99.58,99.76],["at",99.76,99.88],["the",99.88,99.96],["computer",99.96,100.24]]},{"start":100.24,"end":103.88,"text":"terminal. You'll be shown a diagram of the bikes that are currently available","words":[["terminal.",100.24,100.7],["You'll",101.22,101.42],["be",101.42,101.5],["shown",101.5,101.72],["a",101.72,101.88],["diagram",101.88,102.22],["of",102.22,102.5],["the",102.5,102.6],["bikes",102.6,102.9],["that",102.9,103.06],["are",103.06,103.14],["currently",103.14,103.44],["available",103.44,103.88]]},{"start":103.88,"end":107.46,"text":"at the station so you just choose the one you want by touching the screen.","words":[["at",103.88,104.12],["the",104.12,104.22],["station",104.22,104.58],["so",104.58,104.9],["you",104.9,105.06],["just",105.06,105.22],["choose",105.22,105.54],["the",105.54,105.74],["one",105.74,105.92],["you",105.92,106.08],["want",106.08,106.32],["by",106.32,106.6],["touching",106.6,106.96],["the",106.96,107.2],["screen.",107.2,107.46]]},{"start":107.96,"end":112.08,"text":"You don't need a password or anything. Once you've chosen your bike you can","words":[["You",107.96,108.1],["don't",108.1,108.36],["need",108.36,108.54],["a",108.54,108.66],["password",108.66,108.94],["or",108.94,109.18],["anything.",109.18,109.4],["Once",110.36,110.74],["you've",110.74,110.92],["chosen",110.92,111.26],["your",111.26,111.44],["bike",111.44,111.7],["you",111.7,111.94],["can",111.94,112.08]]},{"start":112.08,"end":115.54,"text":"And then go to where the bikes are stored and push the release button.","words":[["And",112.08,112.14],["then",112.14,112.3],["go",112.3,112.52],["to",112.52,112.74],["where",112.74,112.88],["the",112.88,113.0],["bikes",113.0,113.28],["are",113.28,113.46],["stored",113.46,113.78],["and",113.78,114.1],["push",114.1,114.48],["the",114.48,114.84],["release",114.84,115.2],["button.",115.2,115.54]]},{"start":116.16,"end":120.08,"text":"After you do that, you have about 10 seconds to take the bike out of the rack.","words":[["After",116.16,116.42],["you",116.42,116.56],["do",116.56,116.68],["that,",116.68,116.94],["you",117.1,117.22],["have",117.22,117.38],["about",117.38,117.6],["10",117.6,118.06],["seconds",118.06,118.44],["to",118.44,118.66],["take",118.66,118.88],["the",118.88,119.02],["bike",119.02,119.28],["out",119.28,119.64],["of",119.64,119.76],["the",119.76,119.88],["rack.",119.88,120.08]]},{"start":120.84,"end":122.42,"text":"You can now start your bike ride.","words":[["You",120.84,120.92],["can",120.92,121.1],["now",121.1,121.34],["start",121.34,121.72],["your",121.72,121.92],["bike",121.92,122.2],["ride.",122.2,122.42]]},{"start":123.9,"end":128.88,"text":"Further down the track, we're thinking about adding lockers for bags if the scheme is","words":[["Further",123.9,124.38],["down",124.38,124.58],["the",124.58,124.68],["track,",124.68,124.96],["we're",125.48,125.88],["thinking",125.88,126.14],["about",126.14,126.46],["adding",126.46,126.78],["lockers",126.78,127.3],["for",127.3,127.44],["bags",127.44,127.86],["if",127.86,128.22],["the",128.22,128.38],["scheme",128.38,128.74],["is",128.74,128.88]]},{"start":128.88,"end":129.22,"text":"popular.","words":[["popular.",128.88,129.22]]},{"start":129.92,"end":135.02,"text":"Oh, at this point, can I just clarify something that a few people have been asking and that","words":[["Oh,",129.92,130.16],["at",130.4,130.48],["this",130.48,130.66],["point,",130.66,130.96],["can",131.12,131.3],["I",131.3,131.42],["just",131.42,131.74],["clarify",131.74,132.14],["something",132.14,132.64],["that",132.64,132.96],["a",132.96,133.1],["few",133.1,133.32],["people",133.32,133.62],["have",133.62,133.88],["been",133.88,134.1],["asking",134.1,134.38],["and",134.38,134.74],["that",134.74,135.02]]},{"start":135.02,"end":136.94,"text":"is, do I have to wear a helmet?","words":[["is,",135.02,135.4],["do",135.68,135.92],["I",135.92,136.06],["have",136.06,136.24],["to",136.24,136.38],["wear",136.38,136.54],["a",136.54,136.68],["helmet?",136.68,136.94]]},{"start":137.46,"end":139.4,"text":"Well, the answer is yes, you do.","words":[["Well,",137.46,137.74],["the",137.76,137.9],["answer",137.9,138.12],["is",138.12,138.36],["yes,",138.36,138.8],["you",139.18,139.26],["do.",139.26,139.4]]},{"start":139.4,"end":144.44,"text":"That's a requirement by law in this state so don't forget to wear one at all times when","words":[["That's",139.4,140.28],["a",140.28,140.3],["requirement",140.3,140.74],["by",140.74,141.2],["law",141.2,141.46],["in",141.46,141.64],["this",141.64,141.82],["state",141.82,142.06],["so",142.06,142.38],["don't",142.38,142.74],["forget",142.74,142.96],["to",142.96,143.16],["wear",143.16,143.36],["one",143.36,143.56],["at",143.56,143.68],["all",143.68,143.8],["times",143.8,144.2],["when",144.2,144.44]]},{"start":144.44,"end":144.76,"text":"riding.","words":[["riding.",144.44,144.76]]},{"start":145.6,"end":150.2,"text":"Now at the end of your trip just come back to one of the city cycle stations and wheel","words":[["Now",145.6,146.04],["at",146.04,146.4],["the",146.4,146.5],["end",146.5,146.64],["of",146.64,146.74],["your",146.74,146.84],["trip",146.84,147.04],["just",147.04,147.58],["come",147.58,147.86],["back",147.86,148.06],["to",148.06,148.24],["one",148.24,148.34],["of",148.34,148.44],["the",148.44,148.58],["city",148.58,148.8],["cycle",148.8,149.16],["stations",149.16,149.52],["and",149.52,149.88],["wheel",149.88,150.2]]},{"start":150.2,"end":151.3,"text":"the bike into the bike rack.","words":[["the",150.2,150.38],["bike",150.38,150.58],["into",150.58,150.8],["the",150.8,150.94],["bike",150.94,151.1],["rack.",151.1,151.3]]},{"start":152.04,"end":156.6,"text":"It's important to make sure that the bike is properly secured because you could be","words":[["It's",152.04,152.38],["important",152.38,152.8],["to",152.8,153.08],["make",153.08,153.26],["sure",153.26,153.62],["that",153.62,153.88],["the",153.88,154.0],["bike",154.0,154.22],["is",154.22,154.4],["properly",154.4,154.76],["secured",154.76,155.36],["because",155.36,155.92],["you",155.92,156.16],["could",156.16,156.38],["be",156.38,156.6]]},{"start":156.6,"end":157.9,"text":"held liable if it goes missing.","words":[["held",156.6,156.78],["liable",156.78,157.16],["if",157.16,157.32],["it",157.32,157.4],["goes",157.4,157.56],["missing.",157.56,157.9]]},{"start":158.52,"end":162.4,"text":"The green light on the rack will confirm that it has been locked into place.","words":[["The",158.52,158.94],["green",158.94,159.18],["light",159.18,159.48],["on",159.48,159.68],["the",159.68,159.8],["rack",159.8,160.12],["will",160.12,160.48],["confirm",160.48,160.94],["that",160.94,161.18],["it",161.18,161.28],["has",161.28,161.38],["been",161.38,161.56],["locked",161.56,161.8],["into",161.8,161.98],["place.",161.98,162.4]]},{"start":163.02,"end":166.3,"text":"So we hope that with such a simple scheme we'll have many users.","words":[["So",163.02,163.5],["we",163.5,163.88],["hope",163.88,164.08],["that",164.08,164.2],["with",164.2,164.3],["such",164.3,164.48],["a",164.48,164.62],["simple",164.62,164.86],["scheme",164.86,165.26],["we'll",165.26,165.52],["have",165.52,165.68],["many",165.68,165.94],["users.",165.94,166.3]]},{"start":166.3,"end":176.17,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20 on","words":[["Before",166.3,167.0],["you",170.11,170.33],["hear",170.33,170.51],["the",170.51,170.67],["rest",170.67,170.95],["of",170.95,171.07],["the",171.07,171.17],["talk,",171.17,171.47],["you",171.89,172.07],["have",172.07,172.27],["some",172.27,172.47],["time",172.47,172.89],["to",172.89,173.27],["look",173.27,173.43],["at",173.43,173.57],["questions",173.57,173.89],["16",173.89,174.73],["to",174.73,174.97],["20",174.97,175.43],["on",175.43,176.17]]},{"start":176.17,"end":206.09,"text":"page 4. Now listen and answer questions 16 to 20.","words":[["page",176.17,176.51],["4.",176.51,177.07],["Now",202.33,202.65],["listen",202.65,203.03],["and",203.03,203.65],["answer",203.65,204.01],["questions",204.01,204.39],["16",204.39,205.31],["to",205.31,205.59],["20.",205.59,206.09]]},{"start":209.76,"end":214.78,"text":"Let's turn to another initiative, the layout of the new Council Bicycle Centre, which will","words":[["Let's",209.76,210.06],["turn",210.06,210.26],["to",210.26,210.44],["another",210.44,210.74],["initiative,",210.74,211.26],["the",211.74,211.86],["layout",211.86,212.2],["of",212.2,212.54],["the",212.54,212.7],["new",212.7,212.84],["Council",212.84,213.22],["Bicycle",213.22,213.8],["Centre,",213.8,214.2],["which",214.5,214.68],["will",214.68,214.78]]},{"start":214.78,"end":220.46,"text":"be opening next week. This is for people who already own a bike. We wanted to provide","words":[["be",214.78,214.9],["opening",214.9,215.16],["next",215.16,215.5],["week.",215.5,215.78],["This",216.6,216.98],["is",216.98,217.2],["for",217.2,217.42],["people",217.42,217.7],["who",217.7,217.98],["already",217.98,218.38],["own",218.38,218.7],["a",218.7,218.78],["bike.",218.78,219.0],["We",219.46,219.62],["wanted",219.62,219.92],["to",219.92,220.12],["provide",220.12,220.46]]},{"start":220.46,"end":226.42,"text":"a place for cyclists to store their bikes, then change before going on to work. Can","words":[["a",220.46,220.74],["place",220.74,220.94],["for",220.94,221.18],["cyclists",221.18,221.78],["to",221.78,222.2],["store",222.2,222.52],["their",222.52,222.72],["bikes,",222.72,223.1],["then",223.44,223.68],["change",223.68,224.02],["before",224.02,224.32],["going",224.32,224.66],["on",224.66,224.8],["to",224.8,224.94],["work.",224.94,225.2],["Can",226.04,226.42]]},{"start":226.42,"end":227.28,"text":"Can you all see the plan?","words":[["Can",226.42,226.5],["you",226.5,226.64],["all",226.64,226.82],["see",226.82,226.96],["the",226.96,227.06],["plan?",227.06,227.28]]},{"start":228.06,"end":233.14,"text":"If you look at the bottom towards the right hand corner, you'll see where the cyclists","words":[["If",228.06,228.36],["you",228.36,228.5],["look",228.5,228.7],["at",228.7,228.84],["the",228.84,229.04],["bottom",229.04,229.48],["towards",229.48,229.92],["the",229.92,230.34],["right",230.34,230.56],["hand",230.56,230.8],["corner,",230.8,231.22],["you'll",231.76,231.98],["see",231.98,232.2],["where",232.2,232.4],["the",232.4,232.56],["cyclists",232.56,233.14]]},{"start":233.14,"end":234.02,"text":"enter the centre.","words":[["enter",233.14,233.52],["the",233.52,233.74],["centre.",233.74,234.02]]},{"start":234.98,"end":237.52,"text":"People want more than just a place to park their bikes.","words":[["People",234.98,235.24],["want",235.24,235.54],["more",235.54,235.86],["than",235.86,236.06],["just",236.06,236.26],["a",236.26,236.44],["place",236.44,236.64],["to",236.64,236.84],["park",236.84,237.02],["their",237.02,237.2],["bikes.",237.2,237.52]]},{"start":237.92,"end":239.66,"text":"That's why you'll see a coffee cart.","words":[["That's",237.92,238.32],["why",238.32,238.54],["you'll",238.54,238.82],["see",238.82,239.06],["a",239.06,239.2],["coffee",239.2,239.38],["cart.",239.38,239.66]]},{"start":240.68,"end":244.7,"text":"That's it there between the reception desk and the vending machines.","words":[["That's",240.68,241.24],["it",241.24,241.34],["there",241.34,241.86],["between",241.86,242.3],["the",242.3,242.66],["reception",242.66,243.04],["desk",243.04,243.46],["and",243.46,243.9],["the",243.9,244.08],["vending",244.08,244.3],["machines.",244.3,244.7]]},{"start":245.44,"end":248.78,"text":"I'm sure it'll be very popular with commuters first thing in the morning.","words":[["I'm",245.44,245.78],["sure",245.78,246.06],["it'll",246.06,246.38],["be",246.38,246.5],["very",246.5,246.74],["popular",246.74,247.16],["with",247.16,247.36],["commuters",247.36,247.82],["first",247.82,248.14],["thing",248.14,248.34],["in",248.34,248.46],["the",248.46,248.54],["morning.",248.54,248.78]]},{"start":249.74,"end":256.0,"text":"Now of course some of our cyclists have very expensive bikes, so we'll have a totally","words":[["Now",249.74,250.26],["of",250.26,250.6],["course",250.6,250.92],["some",250.92,251.36],["of",251.36,251.5],["our",251.5,251.62],["cyclists",251.62,252.26],["have",252.26,252.66],["very",252.66,253.08],["expensive",253.08,253.48],["bikes,",253.48,254.1],["so",254.52,254.78],["we'll",254.78,255.04],["have",255.04,255.28],["a",255.28,255.56],["totally",255.56,256.0]]},{"start":256.0,"end":262.52,"text":"secure place for them to park. That's it in the top right hand corner. Now there's another","words":[["secure",256.0,256.42],["place",256.42,256.86],["for",256.86,257.1],["them",257.1,257.22],["to",257.22,257.34],["park.",257.34,257.62],["That's",258.44,258.96],["it",258.96,259.12],["in",259.12,259.74],["the",259.74,259.9],["top",259.9,260.18],["right",260.18,260.4],["hand",260.4,260.64],["corner.",260.64,260.92],["Now",261.56,261.9],["there's",261.9,262.2],["another",262.2,262.52]]},{"start":262.52,"end":268.2,"text":"special service for the cyclists that I'd like to show you. Look back at the entry on the map.","words":[["special",262.52,262.84],["service",262.84,263.36],["for",263.36,263.54],["the",263.54,263.66],["cyclists",263.66,264.26],["that",264.26,264.6],["I'd",264.6,264.8],["like",264.8,264.94],["to",264.94,265.14],["show",265.14,265.38],["you.",265.38,265.6],["Look",266.3,266.74],["back",266.74,267.12],["at",267.12,267.3],["the",267.3,267.46],["entry",267.46,267.72],["on",267.72,267.88],["the",267.88,267.96],["map.",267.96,268.2]]},{"start":268.7,"end":272.64,"text":"Just to the left of reception on the Donovan Street side of the building,","words":[["Just",268.7,269.0],["to",269.0,269.22],["the",269.22,269.32],["left",269.32,269.54],["of",269.54,269.74],["reception",269.74,270.12],["on",270.12,270.72],["the",270.72,270.92],["Donovan",270.92,271.32],["Street",271.32,271.72],["side",271.72,272.12],["of",272.12,272.28],["the",272.28,272.38],["building,",272.38,272.64]]},{"start":273.02,"end":278.44,"text":"you'll see quite a large room. That's the workshop where cyclists will be able to leave","words":[["you'll",273.02,273.36],["see",273.36,273.52],["quite",273.52,273.82],["a",273.82,274.0],["large",274.0,274.3],["room.",274.3,274.6],["That's",275.18,275.7],["the",275.7,275.94],["workshop",275.94,276.34],["where",276.34,276.8],["cyclists",276.8,277.48],["will",277.48,277.86],["be",277.86,277.96],["able",277.96,278.12],["to",278.12,278.3],["leave",278.3,278.44]]},{"start":278.44,"end":283.34,"text":"their bikes for repairs while they are at work. We've put a lot of thought into the","words":[["their",278.44,278.66],["bikes",278.66,278.98],["for",278.98,279.22],["repairs",279.22,279.68],["while",279.68,280.14],["they",280.14,280.32],["are",280.32,280.42],["at",280.42,280.54],["work.",280.54,280.74],["We've",281.5,281.9],["put",281.9,282.04],["a",282.04,282.18],["lot",282.18,282.48],["of",282.48,282.64],["thought",282.64,282.94],["into",282.94,283.18],["the",283.18,283.34]]},{"start":283.34,"end":288.02,"text":"facilities of the centre. If you have any valuables with you you can leave these in","words":[["facilities",283.34,283.72],["of",283.72,284.0],["the",284.0,284.14],["centre.",284.14,284.44],["If",285.22,285.34],["you",285.34,285.44],["have",285.44,285.6],["any",285.6,285.9],["valuables",285.9,286.42],["with",286.42,286.66],["you",286.66,286.8],["you",286.8,287.14],["can",287.14,287.3],["leave",287.3,287.52],["these",287.52,287.76],["in",287.76,288.02]]},{"start":288.02,"end":293.06,"text":"our lockers. The locker room is in the top left hand corner of your plan so you","words":[["our",288.02,288.14],["lockers.",288.14,288.54],["The",289.02,289.24],["locker",289.24,289.46],["room",289.46,289.82],["is",289.82,290.0],["in",290.0,290.12],["the",290.12,290.24],["top",290.24,290.46],["left",290.46,290.62],["hand",290.62,290.86],["corner",290.86,291.24],["of",291.24,291.4],["your",291.4,291.52],["plan",291.52,291.84],["so",291.84,292.88],["you",292.88,293.06]]},{"start":293.06,"end":297.58,"text":"can store your bag or wallet there before you head off for a shower. We've","words":[["can",293.06,293.2],["store",293.2,293.5],["your",293.5,293.66],["bag",293.66,294.0],["or",294.0,294.24],["wallet",294.24,294.48],["there",294.48,294.84],["before",294.84,295.1],["you",295.1,295.38],["head",295.38,295.58],["off",295.58,295.8],["for",295.8,296.18],["a",296.18,296.36],["shower.",296.36,296.62],["We've",297.32,297.58]]},{"start":297.58,"end":301.92,"text":"installed 10 state-of-the-art power showers. They are located in this room","words":[["installed",297.58,297.92],["10",297.92,298.34],["state",298.34,298.74],["-of",298.74,298.94],["-the",298.94,299.1],["-art",299.1,299.3],["power",299.3,299.64],["showers.",299.64,300.02],["They",300.42,300.58],["are",300.58,300.76],["located",300.76,301.16],["in",301.16,301.52],["this",301.52,301.68],["room",301.68,301.92]]},{"start":301.92,"end":307.32,"text":"here to the left of the hairdryers and just near the exit. There's also a","words":[["here",301.92,302.4],["to",302.4,303.1],["the",303.1,303.26],["left",303.26,303.48],["of",303.48,303.66],["the",303.66,303.78],["hairdryers",303.78,304.4],["and",304.4,304.78],["just",304.78,305.1],["near",305.1,305.32],["the",305.32,305.48],["exit.",305.48,305.78],["There's",306.36,306.78],["also",306.78,307.06],["a",307.06,307.32]]},{"start":307.32,"end":311.24,"text":"water cooler available so you can grab a drink and then pick up a towel next to","words":[["water",307.32,307.5],["cooler",307.5,307.84],["available",307.84,308.24],["so",308.24,308.68],["you",308.68,308.8],["can",308.8,308.94],["grab",308.94,309.2],["a",309.2,309.36],["drink",309.36,309.54],["and",309.54,309.84],["then",309.84,310.0],["pick",310.0,310.24],["up",310.24,310.42],["a",310.42,310.56],["towel",310.56,310.84],["next",310.84,311.04],["to",311.04,311.24]]},{"start":311.24,"end":320.71,"text":"That is the end of section 2. You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["That",311.24,312.1],["is",314.85,316.21],["the",316.21,316.35],["end",316.35,316.57],["of",316.57,316.69],["section",316.69,316.95],["2.",316.95,317.49],["You",318.25,318.49],["now",318.49,318.71],["have",318.71,318.95],["half",318.95,319.23],["a",319.23,319.41],["minute",319.41,319.55],["to",319.55,319.75],["check",319.75,320.01],["your",320.01,320.29],["answers.",320.29,320.71]]}]}